   "reference": "try every offset, cut the sequence into pieces and test each piece with a set",
   "candidate_design": "for each pair of consecutive equal plays at positions j < i with i - j < numSongs, the cut must fall in j+1..i, an arc of residues mod numSongs; add each arc to a difference array and accept when some residue is covered by every arc",
